  "description": "Welcome to Nectar!\n\nNectar is an effervescent gastronomic haven that offers a multi-sensory, rebellious and contemporary experience in a collective atmosphere. Our team of experts believes that cooking should be a celebration and we strive to offer our diners a moment of discovery and experimentation.\n\nWe believe that every bite of food should be a sensory experience. That's why we devote ourselves to creating an olfactory spectacle and an explosion of flavors on every plate. Our aim is to make your dining experience a memorable one.",
